# MEMORY — {{PROJECT_NAME}} (project-local)

> The project's own long-term memory — distinct from any global/host memory. Two
> tiers: a **lightweight always-loaded fact set** (this file, boot set) + an
> **optional heavy vector store** queried on demand. This is *project* knowledge that
> isn't derivable from the code or git history: settled decisions, hard-won facts,
> "why we do it this way." Loaded once per session (boot set).

